            "round_number": 1,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-12T03:27:54.892204+00:00",
            "notes": "Taking [Super Visor](item_b3db0ab0-26b4-4d99-893d-175f6726c9e9) is my to-go for this build this round. Although you can pick [Double Helix](item_808afc07-1398-4962-bf2c-f8e3b74014e3), I highly recommend building around your weapon most of the time. Super Visor is important as it gives a 0.5 second visor every Helix Rocket. This makes it very easy for you to get value no matter the position. \n\n---\n\nYou will be shooting a lot in this round. I would take [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) and [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318). The reason I took [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) over [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) is because I think having more [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) is more important than [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) as [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) supports more consistent damage over the burst damage that is already given to you by the [Super Visor](item_b3db0ab0-26b4-4d99-893d-175f6726c9e9).\n\n---\n\n[Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) is pretty explainable as survivability is very important in the early rounds to gain the cash needed to dominate the later rounds. \n\n---\n\nFor more consistent firing, take [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) for more ammunition. Many times when a opponent is low, you suddenly need to reload, which then causes more time for them to escape and get healing.",
