            "created_at": "2025-09-12T03:27:54.892204+00:00",
            "notes": "Take [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) for the more consistent damage from the increase in [Max Ammo](stat_max_ammo) and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed). [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) is crucial for increasing the [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed). It is my favorite item for this build as it is very cheap and improves [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) by 10% (which is a large amount for its cost) and [Move Speed](stat_move_speed) which is just a bonus. \n\n---\n\nBuying [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) to replace [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) is good because balancing [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) and [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) can lead to the most damage output. \n\n---\n\nIf there is a flying hero in the opponent's team ([Pharah](hero_0baf7420-ff13-4b92-81f7-ca21b61dacf9) or [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da)) or a hero that takes advantage of their mobility kit ([Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424)), taking [Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182) is a good way of creating space for your team as you remove a lot of pressure from the sky that has been disrupting the backline of your team.",
