            "notes": "This round I took [Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) if there is a enemy that has been poking our team a lot or a carry tank who always run into our backline. This focus-fires and melts a singular person quickly because of the additional [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed). Although [Peripheral Pulse](item_f024f11e-2fff-40cf-9e2d-fbaa21fa1371) is a solid choice for a lot of other options. \n\n---\n\nI took [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) for the [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) so that I could balance out the [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) with the [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) for more damage output.  I took it with [Pulse Converter](item_a93a8a8e-28d1-4b02-8d80-3234f9eea3dc) as it gives more [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) and more Ammo every time a Helix Rocket is fired.",
